nditions to complete healthy and radiant skin. 🖤 ​​Black Tea Ampoule 7ml An ampoule that creates healthy, glowing skin as if you had a good night''s sleep, including skin elasticity, moisturizing, whitening, and skin texture improvement for tired skin condition. 🖤 ​​Black Tea Essence 25ml A refreshing and quick-absorbing water essence that provides daily skin antioxidant and anti-aging care. Experience a smoother skin texture with the dead skin turnover care effect that improves dull and rough skin texture due to excessive dead skin cells accumulated due to tired skin condition. [How to use] Apply gently to the face according to the skin care step and let it absorb. [Product capacity] Ampoule 7ml Essence 25m #Good price #Good quality #Korean cosmetics #K-beauty ———————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ♡Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√', 43.0, 35.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Facial Moisturizer', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rdyn-lxlwz9aomrc950', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F23891900008', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
